  "description": "<p>The bat scripts that are used to compile and run the demo soapclient located in fedora_home/client/demo/soapclient do not reflect the name change of the client.jar file in Fedora 2.2. In 2.2, this jar file was renamed as fedora-client.jar(previously it had just been client.jar).</p>\n\n<p>A workaround is to edit compile-demo-soapclient.bat and run-demo-soapclient.bat and change all occurrences of client.jar to fedora-client.jar.</p>",
